 "author": "MrSteelballs",
 "description": "A Minecraft look for KamiOS: square blocky tiles, grass-green accents, enchantment-glint notifications, XP-orb shade animation, classic battery, pixel icons for the volume panel and status bar, textured volume and brightness sliders. Use with Minecraft XP pill for best experience",
